{"id":"c1c8665663a75504","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-consistency-undecidable.md","title":"Consistency Statement Unprovable","display":"cor-consistency-undecidable — Consistency Statement Unprovable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-consistency-undecidable","aliases":["89-cor-consistency-undecidable"],"display":"cor-consistency-undecidable — Consistency Statement Unprovable","depends_on":["[[89-df-consistency-statement]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-consistency-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-consistency-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-consistency-undecidable — Consistency Statement Unprovable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00938a3b569dba72\" href=\"?note=00938a3b569dba72\" title=\"89-df-consistency-statement\">89-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a consistent recursively axiomatized theory extending PA.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is its provable-sentence set,\nand <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_T\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\">\\(\\bot_T\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\)</span> is the fixed contradiction.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\\)</span> satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)=\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)=\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is the internal consistency sentence.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\bot_T\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\bot_T\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span> : 一致性陈述 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"00938a3b569dba72\" href=\"?note=00938a3b569dba72\" title=\"89-df-consistency-statement\">89-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})\\)</span> : the\nobject-language assertion that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> proves a contradiction</li>\n<li>第二不完备性定理的模态形式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li>结论是内部一致性句在一致的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中不可证。它本身不证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span> 也不可证，所以标题改为“不可证”，不再误称\n双向的“不可判定”。文件名保留作链接兼容。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ : 一致性陈述 (see [[89-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"第二不完备性定理的模态形式 (see [[89-thm-lob-theorem]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_T\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(T)=\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\bot_T\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\notin\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_T\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Con}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1648,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-554","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-consistency-undecidable]]"}],"outgoing":["00938a3b569dba72","2d52ad4f119b4a14","9aca87310232fb2f","77b58358ab49cf8f"]}